            "repere": "Paragraphe · \"I will do no more surgeries.\" She says ",
            "text": "\"I will do no more <b>surgeries.</b>\" She says fiercely. \"No more. I make an appointment with the doctor and get a second opinion. I cannot live like this anymore. I need to sleep.\"",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
