            "repere": "Paragraphe · Claire's second opinion took on a more h",
            "text": "Claire's second opinion took on a more holistic approach. Dr. Shiva has been making a name for herself in the local area over the last few years. She prides herself on helping patients recover from addictions and detox their bodies of heavy metals, alongside her daily work as a resident expert in the neurology department of the university.",
