            "slot": "s53",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · \"I knew what we were dealing with, here,",
            "text": "\"I knew what we were dealing with, here,\" Dr. Shiva said, \"and I knew exactly what to tell Claire. If you are worried about your pain, you must first worry about your sleep. If your body doesn't have rest...true, deep, REM-cycles throughout the night...you're going to have pain, especially at her age.\"",
