            "repere": "Paragraphe · I've tried just about every pillow on th",
            "text": "I've tried just about every pillow on the market for relief from right clavicle-right shoulder pain which has plagued me for most of the year. Despite frequent swimming and doing yoga, and seeing the doc, it would not let up. Until I bought this pillow, nothing helped.",
