            "slot": "s92",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · I felt obligated to write a review on th",
            "text": "I felt obligated to write a review on this pillow. Used it for the first time last night and I couldn't believe how I slept. I purchased over 5 different pillows and nothing worked. It was horrible until this arrived. I was blown away when I woke up well-rested and absolutely NO PAIN. I was so happy and wanted to share it with you guys. I had an ACDF neck procedure and this pillow simply works as described. Nice packaging and very comfortable. The shoulder shape and cervical curve are PERFECT !. Trust me people you don't want to miss this one !! Looking to get another one for my mother!",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
